{"parse": {"title": "GM-01", "pageid": 93623, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">GM-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/GM-02\" title=\"GM-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">GM</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A4.B1.E8.B8.AA.E5.A4.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"失踪夜\">失踪夜</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 失踪夜</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Missing in the Night</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>请<span class=\"color-value\"></span>非<span class=\"color-value\"></span>租<span class=\"color-value\"></span>客<span class=\"color-value\"></span>保<span class=\"color-value\"></span>持<span class=\"color-value\"></span>安<span class=\"color-value\"></span>静<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_louceng1\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_louceng1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>跨过蜡烛与纸堆，职员们小心翼翼，蹑手蹑脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣洛夫基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>这阴风阵阵的，您不害怕吗？约书亚先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣洛夫基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>你在开玩笑吗？威廉……他可是圣洛夫基金会里赫赫有名的调查员，我还以为自从绿湖事件以后，约书亚先生的名头早就传遍了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>噢，我不喜欢给其他人留下刻板印象。留些悬念，米莉……还请别告诉他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>等这次调查圆满结束，才是主角的扮演人员弹出荧幕的时候。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_louceng2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_louceng2\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_louceng2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_5_bg_louceng2.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_louceng2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_5_bg_louceng2.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_louceng2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_5_bg_louceng2.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_louceng2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他在铁门前蹲下来，用手划过地面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-306110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-306110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-306110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>灰尘已经积了有一阵子……确切的失踪时间肯定比我们所知晓的更早一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-306112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-306112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-306112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>加上这些缴费单和宣传广告纸——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咚”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-306113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-306113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-306113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>嘶……噢，疼！谁在敲我脑袋——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>打着烫发卷的包租婆，叼着牙签，手执卷起的报纸，站在身后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>你们在我的楼里鬼鬼祟祟，想做些什么啊！尤其是你，四眼仔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>左望右望，偷偷摸摸——你信不信我分分钟叫阿sir过来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣洛夫基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>女士，我们已经通知了本地的巡警，这次调查已经经由了许可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>你们来调查什么，我这栋楼好旺的，别来烦我D租户啊，否则我投诉你们啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她亮出了手里的圣洛夫基金会调查许可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>“剩裸夫基金会”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣洛夫基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>我们正在调查鬼魂治理协会的两名成员的失踪案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣洛夫基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>而李安安小姐，是我们的外聘职员，只是她与我们失联了有一段时日……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人半信半疑地从她们之间穿过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>这扇门坏好久了，关上就会锁死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>但谁叫她到现在都还未交租啊，我也一直都没找人来修。所以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>本以为紧闭的门被她轻轻推开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣洛夫基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚原本顶住门插哨的口香糖，掉落在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人吐掉牙签，得意地迈入了事务所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>哼，小把戏。同我玩……喇叭妹，你还早一万年啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人迈进了门口，但恐怖通却没有进去的意思，他只是蹲下了身子，环视着乱糟糟的门口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣洛夫基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>约书亚先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>职员跟着他的视线，将目光聚焦到了门口的地面上。那堆零散的报纸与五颜六色的小卡片之间，有张白纸格外显眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>现在已经几点了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>职员耸了耸肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣洛夫基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>马上就要凌晨十二点了。您是收到基金会新的指令了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>不……该走了，我们该走了，时间恐怕马上就要来不及了，我们必须现在马上赶过去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两名基金会成员的目光终于定睛在了那张白纸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众成员：</div><div>？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>喂，你们还站在门口干什么？你们不是要进来吗？枉我费力气啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>还有嘞……你们别想就这样走啊！既然她是你们的外聘职员，那么把她的酬劳预支给我当——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着他们迅速的动身，门被卷起的阴风，毫不留情地一把关上了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>当租金……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>喂……喂！别走啦，我还未讲完！还有，这扇门坏了啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她敲打着铁门，焦急得仿若胡乱抓门的家猫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>喂，快回来啊！我被锁住了啊！四眼仔，你们一群白眼狼啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门外的脚步声慢下来，旋即远远传来了应答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-500101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-500101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-500101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣洛夫基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>抱歉，女士！现在局势非常不妙，暂时没有时间帮助您脱身！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:125%\">我们</span><span style=\"font-size:116%\">解决</span><span style=\"font-size:108%\">完</span>事情，<span style=\"font-size:83%\">马上就回来</span>！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>包租婆握紧双拳，拧成了沙包一样大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>死差佬……下次见面一定向你们上司投诉，不……不只投诉，我还要你们赔十倍精神损失费啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等眼睛习惯了黑暗，她终于也看到了地面上的格外反光的白纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拾起来，眯着眼睛，一字一顿的读了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-632301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">包租婆：</div><div>“西区灯塔，三更，两颗人头落地前见我。”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>头痛欲裂，眼前的一切都在摇晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>血从前额淌下，滴落在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-565320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-565320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-565320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>又见面了，豆丁……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303915.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-303915.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303915.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303915.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-303915.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303915.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-303915.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303915.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>呃……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dengta.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dengta\"><img alt=\"dengta\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-dengta.png/600px-Cg-dengta.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-dengta.png/900px-Cg-dengta.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-dengta.png/1200px-Cg-dengta.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-303913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-303913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-303913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>哪位……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仰起头，那是一张胡子拉碴的面孔，以及疲惫气虚的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>衣领已经被脖颈的油脂沾得发黄，蹲下来的身子露出脏兮兮的裤衩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被蹂躏得松松垮垮的人字拖上，一只手在挠着脚踝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>——师父？！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "GM-01"}}